          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Dum in synagoga Christum Posthac palam praedicas, Hunc convertis, jam et istum Sanas, et resuscitas, Stygem pellis, idolorum Excutis daemonia, Pro mercede tot laborum, Dura fers et aspera.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            583,
            584
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prime-b0004",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Ant. Ter virgins caesus, semel lapidatus sum, ter naufragium feci, nocte et die in periculis fui, in labore, aerumna, vigiliis, fame et siti.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
