            584
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "sext-b0004",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "At, quam Insula humana, Atrox tam est vipera, Mordet haec: sed ira vana, Viru quasi vacua.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            584
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "sext-b0005",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Ant. Cum autem Paulus sarmentorium aliquantam multitudinem imposuisset super ignem, vipera invasit manum ejus: Et ille quidem excutiens bestiam in igne, nihil mali passus est.",
